            {
                "comment": "There is a high reading requirement, but Katherine is smoking hot which makes lectures extremely enjoyable.",
                "difficulty_rating": 4,
                "quality_rating": 4
            },
            {
                "comment": "She is extremely snippy with students, and acts very condescending.  She did not appear to have a firm grasp of the material, and had difficulty answering students' questions much of the time.  When she did, she was often unclear.",
